  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Walk into any Korean convenience store",
      "startFrame": 10,
      "endFrame": 59
    },
    {
      "text": "and half the fridge is wearing a sticker.",
      "startFrame": 60,
      "endFrame": 108
    },
    {
      "text": "One plus one.",
      "startFrame": 109,
      "endFrame": 131
    },
    {
      "text": "Two plus one.",
      "startFrame": 132,
      "endFrame": 155
    },
    {
      "text": "Buy one, take two home.",
      "startFrame": 156,
      "endFrame": 198
    },
    {
      "text": "And here's what almost everyone gets wrong.",
      "startFrame": 199,
      "endFrame": 243
    },
    {
      "text": "No membership card.",
      "startFrame": 244,
      "endFrame": 269
    },
    {
      "text": "No coupon.",
      "startFrame": 270,
      "endFrame": 288
    },
    {
      "text": "No app, and no minimum spend.",
      "startFrame": 289,
      "endFrame": 342
    },
    {
      "text": "The whole thing is settled at the shelf edge.",
      "startFrame": 349,
      "endFrame": 407
    },
    {
      "text": "If the tag says it,",
      "startFrame": 408,
      "endFrame": 433
    },
    {
      "text": "you pick the second one up yourself",
      "startFrame": 434,
      "endFrame": 475
    },
    {
      "text": "and carry both to the counter.",
      "startFrame": 476,
      "endFrame": 518
    },
    {
      "text": "Nobody scans anything.",
      "startFrame": 519,
      "endFrame": 552
    },
    {
      "text": "But say you don't want to lug",
      "startFrame": 553,
      "endFrame": 582
    },
    {
      "text": "a second ice cream around Seoul all afternoon.",
      "startFrame": 583,
      "endFrame": 649
    },
    {
      "text": "The chains do let you bank it",
      "startFrame": 650,
      "endFrame": 685
    },
    {
      "text": "in their app instead.",
      "startFrame": 686,
      "endFrame": 729
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's the tip every English guide hands you.",
      "startFrame": 736,
      "endFrame": 797
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's the problem.",
      "startFrame": 798,
      "endFrame": 821
    },
    {
      "text": "Almost no visitor can actually use it.",
      "startFrame": 822,
      "endFrame": 877
    },
    {
      "text": "Signing up runs through Korean identity verification,",
      "startFrame": 878,
      "endFrame": 955
    },
    {
      "text": "and logging in with Apple",
      "startFrame": 956,
      "endFrame": 984
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't get you around it.",
      "startFrame": 985,
      "endFrame": 1014
    },
    {
      "text": "The gate is inside the app,",
      "startFrame": 1015,
      "endFrame": 1050
    },
    {
      "text": "not the login.",
      "startFrame": 1051,
      "endFrame": 1080
    }
  ],
